me】\nL145: \nL146: 【72†MIT license】\nL147: \nL148: 【73†Activity】\nL149: \nL150: ### Stars\nL151: \nL152: 13 stars\nL153: \nL154: ### Watchers\nL155: \nL156: 2 watching\nL157: \nL158: ### Forks\nL159: \nL160: 【74†0 forks】\nL161: \nL162: 【75†Report repository】\nL163: \nL164: master\nL165: \nL166: 【76†Branches】【77†Tags】\nL167: \nL168: [Input: Go to file]\nL169: \nL170: Go to file\nL171: \nL172: Code\nL173: \nL174: Open more actions menu\nL175: \nL176: ## Latest commit\nL177: \nL178: \nL179: \nL180: ## History\nL181: \nL182: 2 Commits\nL183: ## Folders and files\nL184: Name  | Name  | Last commit message  | Last commit date\nL185: --- | --- | --- | ---\nL186: 【78†include】  | 【78†include】  |    |\nL187: 【79†reduction_bench】  | 【79†reduction_bench】  |    |\nL188: 【80†CMakeLists.txt】  | 【80†CMakeLists.txt】  |    |\nL189: 【81†LICENSE】  | 【81†LICENSE】  |    |\nL190: 【82†README.md】  | 【82†README.md】  |    |\nL191: 【83†bench.cpp】  | 【83†bench.cpp】  |    |\nL192: 【84†bench_cmp_lib.cpp】  | 【84†bench_cmp_lib.cpp】  |    |\nL193: 【85†bench_cmp_ntt_impl.cpp】  | 【85†bench_cmp_ntt_impl.cpp】  |    |\nL194: 【86†prepare.sh】  | 【86†prepare.sh】  |    |\nL195: 【87†test.cpp】  | 【87†test.cpp】  |    |\nL196: ## Repository files navigation\nL197: \nL198:   *   * 【88†README】\nL199:   * 【88†MIT license】\nL200: \nL201: More items\nL202: \nL203: # FasterNTT - A Fast Implementation of Number-theoretic Transform\nL204: \nL205: This is a fast implementation of NTT for Ring-LWE homomorphic encryption, FasterNTT, which is almost twice faster than NFLlib. FasterNTT employs\nL206: \nL207:   * Shoup's trick (for NTT), Montgomery multiplication (for point-wise mult.),\nL208:   * and Scott's slothful NTT instead of Longa-Naehrig's NTT, which is employed in most of all (open-sourced) implementations.\nL209: ## Prerequisites\nL210: \nL211:   * 【89†OpenSSL†www.openssl.org】\nL212: \nL213: ## How to Use\nL214: \nL215: This is a header only library, so just include and enjoy!\nL216: \nL217: For benchmarks and tests, install following libraries:\nL218: \nL219:   * 【90†GMP†gmplib.org】 (for test)\nL220:   * 【91†NTL†www.shoup.net】 (for test)\nL221:   * 【92†google/benchmark】 (for benchmark)\nL222:   * 【93†NFLlib】 (if you want to compare)\nL223:   * 【94†YELL】 (if you want to compare)\nL224: \nL225: then build as usual cmake projects:\nL226: \nL227:     `mkdir build && cd build\nL228:     cmake .. -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\nL229:     `\nL230: ## Abstract\nL231: \nL232: Polynomial multiplication is the main bottleneck in Ring-LWE Cryptography, and most of all implementation researches focus on the Number-theoretic Transform (NTT) for efficient polynomial multiplications. The NTT consists of:\nL233: \nL234:   * modular arithmetic and\nL235:   * butterfly computation.\nL236: \nL237: Their performance has much influence on the performance of polynomial multiplication and so Ring-LWE (homomorphic) encryptions.\nL238: In this work, we comprehensively implemented efficient algorithms of modular arithmetic and NTTs in the Ring-LWE homomorphic encryptions case, and we found the combination of Shoup's trick (for NTT) and Montgomery multiplication (for point-wise multiplication) is the fastest way to compute Ring-LWE polynomial multiplication. Also, we found the Scott's slothful NTT is quite faster than the Longa-Naehrig's NTT, which most of all (open-sourced) implementations employ.\nL239: Our experiment shows that our NTT implementation, which combines (modified) Scott's NTT, Shoup's trick, and Montgomery multiplication, is almost x2 faster than NFLlib, and x1.8 faster than YELL.\nL240: 【95†[Har14]†doi.org】 D. Harvey, \"Faster arithmetic for number-theoretic transforms,\" Journal of Symbolic Computations, Vol.60, pp.113-119, 2014.\nL241: 【96†[LN16]†doi.org】 P. Longa and M. Naehrig, \"Speeding up the Number Theoretic Transform for Faster Ideal Lattice-Based Cryptography,\" CANS 2016, LNCS 10052, pp.124-139, 2016.\nL242: 【97†[Sco17]†doi.org】 M. Scott, \"A Note on the Implementation of the Number Theoretic Transform,\" IMACC 2017, LNCS 10655, pp.247-258, 2017.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn8view3 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://github.com/nict-sfl/FasterNTT/blob/master/LICENSE\",\"lineno\":null}); \nFailed to fetch https://github.com/nict-sfl/FasterNTT/blob/master/LICENSE: Cache miss"
